        {
          "text": "**The Obsidian Projects Plugin:** A more recent and powerful alternative/complement to Kanban, which integrates Kanban, tables, and calendar views in one interface.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 98,
          "source": "topic-set_in-depth-analysis-of-the-obsidian-kanban-plugin_🆔20251030000655.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Dataview Plugin:** A technical dive into the query language used to pull tasks and data from across your vault, often used to *feed* a Kanban board or create dynamic \"MOC\" notes.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 98,
          "source": "topic-set_in-depth-analysis-of-the-obsidian-kanban-plugin_🆔20251030000655.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Obsidian Tasks Plugin:** A focused look at task management at the \"atomic\" level, including recurring tasks, priorities, and filtering, which can be integrated with Kanban.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 103,
          "source": "topic-set_in-depth-analysis-of-the-obsidian-kanban-plugin_🆔20251030000655.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Getting Things Done (GTD) in Obsidian:** Exploring the implementation of the full GTD methodology using a combination of plugins, including Kanban for project visualization.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 103,
          "source": "topic-set_in-depth-analysis-of-the-obsidian-kanban-plugin_🆔20251030000655.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**CSS for Obsidian:** A more general study of how to use CSS snippets to customize any aspect of the Obsidian interface, including the Kanban plugin.",
